          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebik 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kinu nikyo kiragiro ekirukukwata Omunaziri, akasumi ak'okwehonga kwe kamazire kuhwaho: Aleetwege ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahongere MUKAMA ekisembo kye, ekisembo eki, ebe ntaama empaya etanyina kamogo, ey'omwaka gumu, nikyo kibe kihongwa eky'okwokya; entaama eruusi etanyina kamogo ey'omwaka gumu, ebe kihongwa ekyokuganyiza ekibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigega eky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe, keeki ezinyakucumbirwe omu nsaano enyakuniinukire enyakutabwirwemu amagita, na capati ezitatumbisiibwe ezinyakusiigirwe amagita g'omuti oliva, n'ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya n'eky'ebyokunywa ekinyakugenderaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara, ebi abireete omumaiso ga MUKAMA, ahonge ekihongwa kye eky'okuganyiza ebibi, n'ekihongwa kye eky'okwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahongere MUKAMA empaya y'entaama, ebe kyonzira eky'okusaba obusinge, akihonge hamu n'ekigega ekinyakurumu emigaati etatumbisiibwe; kandi ahonge ekihongwa kye eky'ebyokulya, n'eky'okunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunaziri amwe omutwe gwe ogwayeziibwe, agumwere ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu, isoke erirugire ha mutwe gwe ogwayeziibwe, alikwate alinage omu murro ogurukwokezibwaho ekyonzira eky'okusaba obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwate enyama ey'enkwa ey'empaya y'entaama emazire kucumbwa, na keeki emu etatumbisiibwe agiihe omu kigega, bisikwiti emu etatumbisiibwe, abikwase Omunaziri, amazire kwemwa isoke, nukwo ayezibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebi nyakatagara abihongere MUKAMA, kiri kisembo ekyahukaine ha bindi; ebi, nugwo omugabo ogurukwera ogwa nyakatagara, hamu n'embanda enyakwimukaimukibwa, n'ekirumbu ekinyakuhongwa; ebi bimazire kuhwa, Omunaziri ogu naikirizibwa kunywa eviini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
